0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 745 Td (Routing protocols exchange reachability information. RIP is a distance-vector protocol using) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 730 Td (hop count \(maximum 15 usable hops\) and periodic updates. OSPF is a link-state protocol that) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 715 Td (builds a topology database and calculates shortest paths using cost. Static routes are) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 700 Td (manually configured and do not adapt automatically to a failed path. Protocol choices depend) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 685 Td (on scale, convergence, and operational needs.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 55 664 Td (Operating principles) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 643 Td (Routing Protocol Simulation can be understood by following a communication from its source) Tj ET
